4. emilkowalski/skill — INSPIRED-BY ONLY
   Source: https://github.com/emilkowalski/skill
================================================================================

At the time of forking (2026-04-30), the upstream repository emilkowalski/skill
contained no LICENSE file. Default GitHub copyright applies, which means no
permission is granted to redistribute the upstream prose.

The atv-design skill at skills/emil-design-eng-inspired/SKILL.md was authored
fresh by atv-design contributors. It captures the same animation *principles*
as the upstream skill in original prose, with zero verbatim text copied from
the upstream SKILL.md. The original repository is credited as inspiration in
the body of skills/emil-design-eng-inspired/SKILL.md and in the per-bundle
README.

If the upstream emilkowalski/skill repository adds a permissive license in the
future, this fork may consider switching from paraphrase to direct attribution
plus verbatim port. Until then, the inspired-by approach is the legally
defensible posture.

